{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Beach</strong> is a short, absurdist narrative experience where your one and only objective is clear: you have to escape the beach. You can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >traversable beach environment with full day/night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >short story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fully voiced narrator that guides you through the experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >many bizarre objects that appear on the beach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple-choice questions with branching dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collectathon elements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wishlist the game to be notified when it releases!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/fb2fefa91c82a0103fb6d0d2c4a8048a.poster.avif?t=1773827384\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/fb2fefa91c82a0103fb6d0d2c4a8048a.webm?t=1773827384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/fb2fefa91c82a0103fb6d0d2c4a8048a.mp4?t=1773827384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself on a quiet tropical beach. Before you is the vast ocean, behind you\u2014a lush forest. Guiding you under the scorching sun is a soothing but ominous voice, whose intentions you're not quite sure of yet. Is it going to help you leave the beach, or force you to wander endlessly along a serene landscape of water and sand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/0fa094e802649e378854a83bb00024af.poster.avif?t=1773827384\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/0fa094e802649e378854a83bb00024af.webm?t=1773827384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/0fa094e802649e378854a83bb00024af.mp4?t=1773827384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of the beach and bask in its beauty, inquire about the out-of-place objects you find on it, listen to the blunt, sarcastic remarks of the narrator and try to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/166bcacd1b85d859b21db6d628b8dee4.poster.avif?t=1773827384\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/166bcacd1b85d859b21db6d628b8dee4.webm?t=1773827384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/166bcacd1b85d859b21db6d628b8dee4.mp4?t=1773827384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740000?t=1773827384","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740000?t=1773827384","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/888d1bd07803bf830148b5aaae615be00c66dd4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773827384","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/888d1bd07803bf830148b5aaae615be00c66dd4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773827384","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3929210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Beach</strong> is a short, absurdist narrative experience where your one and only objective is clear: you have to escape the beach. You can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >traversable beach environment with full day/night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >short story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fully voiced narrator that guides you through the experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >many bizarre objects that appear on the beach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple-choice questions with branching dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collectathon elements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wishlist the game to be notified when it releases!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/fb2fefa91c82a0103fb6d0d2c4a8048a.poster.avif?t=1773827384\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/fb2fefa91c82a0103fb6d0d2c4a8048a.webm?t=1773827384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/fb2fefa91c82a0103fb6d0d2c4a8048a.mp4?t=1773827384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself on a quiet tropical beach. Before 